      "entry": "pod://62c61be2-abd9-4485-b614-87ee83666495/clinical/notes-and-documents.ttl#fcb7c333e0d9e541d59f84463ba670e117eb6456da13886edf00b9c1e7261e20",
      "field": "https://ns.cascadeprotocol.org/cascade#narrativeText",
      "value": "September 22, 2025 (annual visit, Elena Marsh, MD): Fasting glucose 138 and hemoglobin A1c 6.9%: new diagnosis of type 2 diabetes. Start metformin ER 500 mg with the evening meal; referred to diabetes education. Dry cough for several months on lisinopril: stop lisinopril, start losartan 50 mg daily. Continue amlodipine 5 mg.\nDecember 9, 2025 (follow-up, Elena Marsh, MD): Cough resolved. Blood pressure 142/88, above goal. Add hydrochlorothiazide 12.5 mg daily. A1c 6.7%. Return in 3 months.\nJune 15, 2026 (follow-up, Elena Marsh, MD): Blood pressure 128/80, at goal. A1c 6.6%. Continue current medications. Return in 6 months.",
      "from": "urn:uuid:45c4f0ee-4874-8fbf-89d3-b7d0214ae2cb"
    },
    {
      "entry": "pod://62c61be2-abd9-4485-b614-87ee83666495/clinical/notes-and-documents.ttl#fcb7c333e0d9e541d59f84463ba670e117eb6456da13886edf00b9c1e7261e20",
      "field": "https://ns.cascadeprotocol.org/cascade#narrativeText",
      "value": "September 22, 2025 (annual visit, Elena Marsh, MD): Fasting glucose 138 and hemoglobin A1c 6.9%: new diagnosis of type 2 diabetes. Start metformin ER 500 mg with the evening meal; referred to diabetes education. Dry cough for several months on lisinopril: stop lisinopril, start losartan 50 mg daily. Continue amlodipine 5 mg.\nDecember 9, 2025 (follow-up, Elena Marsh, MD): Cough resolved. Blood pressure 142/88, above goal. Add hydrochlorothiazide 12.5 mg daily. A1c 6.7%. Return in 3 months.",
      "from": "urn:uuid:80afad1b-91cb-8766-b527-1beabf2a4158"
    },
